<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Ekajuk New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">1 Tesalonaika</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Tesalonaika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tes</para>
  <para style="mt2">1 NWER NYI POL NYONO TV</para>
  <para style="mt2">ANEB ERO BA LI GO</para>
  <para style="mt1">TESALONAIKA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Me Pol, go Silvanus, a Timoti, wahr ba kpꞌnyono nwer nyia tv aneb ero ba li go Tesalonaika, bo jio ji li ka Esowo Nsoo, a Ntul a Jisos Kraist.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Nnoobo jol a nahne, a elkoono.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eljini ni aneb Tesalonaika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />E kpo kono Esowo saam kak ngare anyehng anyehng tib wahn ane kpee. Ngare anyehng anyehng nyi e lꞌkak ero ebahre, e kpo gahm-n gahm go egahre ero, <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />fere jo buum-n go esamahr bi Esowo Nso ejahre, ana ń kpo lim eljini enahne jang jang ana ń kpꞌwuku alum Esowo nya ń taame tv, ana elkoro enahne kpo wahng, ń kpo lim eltum sꞌsehng, ana ń kpo kpuumu tib go ekunukpu ejahne ji ḿ ma yehke kunu Ntul a Jisos Kraist, ji kal-n tiki kpaale. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Tibre e kpꞌkahne, abonanee, re Esowo, ń kor-e na, owo á kehm-n yehke. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Etingitingi, nnoobo etib bi e ba tiing-n, e joom bung alum nnyo nya nya, ń fere nyehn nsahm nyio nyi Etingi Etohko,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 2:5</char></note> fere lohko kahn re, alum enyahre lohko li go etingitingi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:5">Tibre ń kpꞌkahne elkpin ana ni e jolo a ni ngare nyi e jolo a nahne. E jo limi ano tib go egahne esi. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Owo wahnge ń kehm leeme eljini enahre, fere tob leeme ni Ntul a Jisos,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 11:1</char></note> eji ń ko alum Esowo go erem anyehne, Etingi Etohko ji wahng ka ń jo bel eyebatahng. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Owo wahnge ḿ ma jol ane ba abon Esowo bako ba li go Masedonia, a Akaya kp-n kpuru re bo leeme eljini enahne.<verse eid="1TH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Tibre wahn ba wahnge alum Esowo ma yeere go Masedonia kpee, a Akaya. O wo wo sang, edi ajehng ajehng limm, ji ane kala wuk bade ana ń kpꞌtaame tv Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 1:8</char></note> Ejumjum kpeem li ji e bahke kpe bung tehk-n. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Ane bao kpee kpo bung bade elvvrv ni ń vvr-r no ngare nyi e ba go egahne, fere bung bade ana ń yake eblom ajomo, fere kpꞌloko Esowo bi li go elkpin, ye ji li go etingitingi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 14:15</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />fere bung bade ana ń kpꞌjehke sik elbake ni Mmon ewe bahke lohngo go ejahbetul Esowo ba, Jisos ji Esowo nyahme go elkv, ye ji bahk-r tahre yake go erakatahng ji Esowo ji kpꞌbake.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tait 2:13</char></note><verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Eltum ni Pol limi go Tesalonaika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Tibre abonanee, wahnfono antahng kpꞌkahne re, elbake enahre ni e ba go egahne, e baam mbol mbol. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Ń kpꞌkahne ana bo jo nohk-r go Filipai, fere jo su-r.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 16:11-40</char></note> Esowo ebahre fere ka-r esahb, e jo tiing-n nnoobo etib ebe, jol eji erem jolo jol a nahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 17:1-9</char></note><verse eid="1TH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Tibre erehke ejahre ji e kpo rehke ane, e kpehme rehke go afahnge, e kpehme kpur ane go emel, jol awak e kpehme lim.<verse eid="1TH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />E kpo kono elbungu ana Esowo kpꞌsebe re wahr bung. Tibre ye wo yehk-r no, fere bum-r go etingitingi, eji á ma yake nnoobo etib ebe kak-r go ebo. E kpehme seb re, wahr lim ji kpꞌkoro ane, e kpo lim ji kpꞌkoro Esowo, ye ji kpo wuungu ntim enyahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 1:10</char></note><verse eid="1TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Tibre ń kpꞌkahne re wahr kpehme tiki foolo anyo, fere jo bung yebe yebe, eji e lꞌjo ko nsol ane. Esowo bi li ntianse enyahre. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />E kpehme seb re ane jo tehk-r, afi jolo wahn, afi jolo ane bako. Jol kehn e kpꞌkpi nsahm nyi e bahke ma ko nsol go egahne, wahr ji li abatiingetib Kraist.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 20:33-34</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Eji e jolo a nahne, e jolo a nahne soom. E jolo ana nnyehn nne no kpo fili abon ebe nob nob. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Ń wob-r go eltim sꞌsehng, owo wahnge e ma yake nnoobo etib ka-n, jol alum Esowo nya nya sang, wahr ebtob yake elkpin enahre fvfo ka-n go eyebatahng, tibre ń jo kor-r sehng. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Etingitingi, abonanee, ń kpꞌbuumu elgbehde ni e jo gbehd, jo lim eltum. Eji e jo tiing-n nnoobo etib bi Esowo, e jo bade, jo lim eltum atv a njul, eji e lꞌkꞌjo tokko nne awohng awohng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 4:12</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Wahn ba li atianse enyahre, ano wo fvfo Esowo tob li ntianse enyahre, ana e jo lim eljini ni Esowo go egahne ellong, wahn ane ba ma taame tv Esowo, fere jol go etingitingi, egahme ajehng ajehng e belem. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Ń kpꞌkahne re, e jo fili nne awohng awohng ewahne ana nde nne kpo fili abon ebe. E jo rehk-n, fere jo kak-n eltim, fere jo tong-n re, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />wahn jo lim eljini ni fuumu a ni Esowo bio bi lung-n no re wahn song kuumu go ege etul, fere bel ellub ene.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Esi jia ana ji wahnge, e kpo tob kak Esowo saam ngare anyehng anyehng, tib eji ń wuku alum Esowo nya e tong-n no, ń tꞌtaame, fere bum re alum nya nne sang, nya Esowo nya, ana lohko li go etingitingi, nya nya kpꞌlimi eltum go egahna ntim, wahn ane ba ma taame tv Esowo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal 1:11-12</char></note><verse eid="1TH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Abonanee, wahn ebtob bel nfem ana nyi aneb ero ba Esowo go Judea bele no, ba taame tv Kraist Jisos. Tibre wahn ebtob nyehn erem bi aneb ejahbe ebahne jo kak-n, jang jang ana bo nyehne erem bi Jus jo kak bo. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Jus ji wulu Ntul a Jisos, fere wul abanyehnamahr Esowo, bo jꞌnehm ji jo nohk-r. Bo kpo sab Esowo. Bo ba li anebekv ba ane kpee, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />tib eji bo kp-r kpane re wahr kꞌkpe bung alum Esowo tong ane ba ki li Jus, nya kehn jolo bo tahre. Eji bo kpꞌlimi ano, abiafem ebo bahke kpe gbal na sehnge eso. Tibre erakatahng ji Esowo ebsi gbꞌgbo tub bo gbalee.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ana Pol jo seb re á kpe song nyehn bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Abonanee, ana e ma tohko yaame a nahne mmongare ntiil, e kil kpe nyehn atemtem go amahr, ntim enyahre li go egahne. Ano wo wahnge jo gbal-r go egahra ntim, e fere jo nok go mbang anyehng anyehng re wahr nyehn-n esamahr.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 1:11-13</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />E sebe re wahr ba go egahne. Me Pol n gare, kpe gare, nnehm kpan-r.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 16:6</char></note><verse eid="1TH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Wahn sang li ane ba ma wahng e kpi ekunukpu re e bahke bele ekpasi eltuuru, a eyebatahng fere geere go esamahr bi Kraist ngare nyi á lꞌbaa?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 2:16; 4:1</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Tibre wahn ba li ane ba e kpo wor nnyo kun-n, fere jo bel eyebatahng.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Eji ki kpe nob elkpooro, esꞌkohro, e kehm toobo re wahr sa ejahre, ji ga Atens,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 17:14-15</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />fere tum mmonanne ejahre Timoti ji kpo lim eltum a nahre ni nnoobo etib atiingi bi Kraist,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elt 16:1-3</char></note> re á ba lim-n, wahn yiimi tꞌtahne go mbang nyi Esowo, fere jo rehk-n, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />eji nne awohng awohng ewahne lꞌkꞌren, tib go erem ebnohko bio. Tibre wahnfono antahng kpꞌkahne re, erem ana bio li ka wahr kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tim 3:12</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Tibre ngare nyi e jolo a nahne, e tohk-n tong re, e bahke tiki jo nyehn erem ebnohko. Ana ń kpꞌkahne, ano wo ma lohko lim. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ano wo wahnge, eji ki kpe nob elkpooro, n kehm tumu Timoti re me n seb kahn ana ekakesehk ejahne li no. Fundiki nnehm ma-n gare, eltum enahre ni e limi no, e limi na lim mbol mbol.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 2:16</char></note><verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Anv, Timoti eblohng go egahne, feere ba ga egahre. Yebko nnoobo etib ba tiing-r bade ekakesehk ejahne, a elkoro enahne ni ń kpi no. Á tooro tong-r re, ń kpo buum-r ngare anyehng anyehng go elkoro. Kp-n koro re wahn nyehn-r, jang jang ana kp-r tob kor re wahr nyehn-n.<verse eid="1TH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Abonanee, go nfem nyi li a nahre, a erem bi e kpꞌnyehne kpee, ekakesehk ejahne ji ma-r kak eltim. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Anv wo, e ma lohko bel elkpin, eji e ma wuk re, wahn eblohko yiimi tꞌtahne go mbang nyi Jehova. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Saam ji e kpꞌkake Esowo nehme gbal ana ji kehn e jol-e kake go eyebatahng ji e kpi no go ege esamahr tib go egahne esi.<verse eid="1TH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />E kpo kak ero a ntim a ntim enyahre atv a njul re, wahr lub nyehn-n esamahr, gohr-n ka ji ma-n rin go egahne ekakesehk.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Nong, Esowo ebahre bi li Nso ejahre antahng antahng, a Jisos Ntul ewahre lim mbang ka-r nyi e bahke sehnge ba go egahne. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Nong, Ntul a Jisos lim elkoro enahne ni ń kpi atemtem, a ane bako, kpe gbal na budu jang jang ana wahn kp-r koro, <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />eji lꞌtoono o, ntim enyahne tahne. Ano wo bahke wahnge, ń kehm jolo saang go esamahr Esowo Nso ejahre, kꞌbel ebꞌbi ajehng ajehng ngare nyio nyi Jisos Ntul ewahre bahke feere, a abarebare ane ebe.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Elkpin ni kpo yebe Esowo atahng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Abonanee, ń jo kpili go egahre ana ḿ bahke jo lim eljini ni kpꞌkoro Esowo. Ano wo ń kpꞌlimi. Anv, n kp-n gohro gboongo, fere jo rehk-n go mbing nyi Ntul a Jisos re wahn jo lim sehnge ano.<verse eid="1TH 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Tibre ń kpꞌkahne erehke ji e ma-n ka, ji Ntul a Jisos ka-r no. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Mbang nyi a, nyi Esowo kpꞌsebe re wahn lim, nyi li re, wahn jol ejahne ejahne, fere jahng asꞌsa. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Nne awohng awohng ewahne nobo re á kahn ana á bahke jo bum ngubjing enye saang go mbang nyi bahke jo ka Esowo ellub. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Kana jo toono mbang nyi ane ba ki nyi Esowo kpo toono, eji bo kpo lim ji kpo kor agubjing ebo. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Nong, nnene kꞌjo soodo mmonannyehn, fere wer-e taare nsol enye. Tibre nne awohng awohng no lꞌlim ano, Jehova wo bahk-e bongo ana e ma-n tohko rehke tꞌtahne. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Tibre Esowo wahr yehkem re wahr lim nsol nyi ki li saang. Á yehk-r re wahr jol ejahre ejahre.<verse eid="1TH 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Nne awohng awohng no lꞌdaang-e eltibi nia, nne sang á daang-e no, Esowo bi á daang-e no, bi kp-n kake Etingi Etohko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 10:16</char></note><verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Nsehng anyehng anyehng kpeem li re wahr nyon tv-n bade elkoro ni abonane ejahre bahke jo kor-r. Tibre Esowo ma-n tib antahng antahng re, wahn jo bel elkoro atemtem.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 13:34</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Etingitingi, abonane ejahne ba li go Masedonia kpee kp-n koro. Abonanee, e kp-n kpeke gboongo re, wahn kpe lim sehnge ano.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 3:13</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Jo noken, wahn bel nnaange eljini, kꞌjo kak anyo go afem ane, wahn fere jo lim eltum, jo le elnahne, ana e tong-n no,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 4:28; 2 Tes 3:12</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />eji ḿ bahke jo lub ane ba ki li aneb Esowo. Kana jo tokko ane bako!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Tes 3:8</char></note><verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elbake ni Kraist bahke bake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Abonane, e kpꞌsebe re wahn kahn etingitingi bade ane bao ba ma kpo, eji ń lꞌkꞌjo rak eltim ana ane bako ba kil elkunu Kraist ekpu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 2:12</char></note><verse eid="1TH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Ana e kpꞌtaame re, Jisos kpꞌkpo, fere nyahme, ano wo fvfo e kpꞌtob taame re, Esowo bahke sehnge goji Jisos, ko ane bao ba taame no tv-e, ba ma kpo, ba a bo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 6:5</char></note><verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Tibre alum nya e kpꞌbungu tong-n ana, alum Jehova nya. Wahr jia ji kpeke li go elkpin, efung bio bi Ntul a Jisos bahke bake, e nehm gbo mbang ka ane ba ma kpo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 15:23</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Ngare nyio nyi, bo bahke woro ntang nyi Esowo, ane fere wuk ellum ni ntubesi enjel. Owo Ntul a Jisos bahke rabe, fere badde go ejahbetul Esowo ba. Ane bao ba ma kpo, ba taame tv Kraist, bo ba bahke gboko mbang nyahme.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 15:52</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Owo bo bahk-r kehm rodo go ekparesemsem, wahr jia ji bahke jolo go elkpin ngare nyio, tahm a nahre go elbung, a ane bako gona fvfo. Owo e bahke song wane Ntul a Jisos, fere jol a ne nkahlkahl.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 17:24</char></note><verse eid="1TH 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Owo fvfo nobo re, wahn jo ko alum nyao, jo kak atemtem eltim.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Tooben ebjing bi Ntul kpꞌbake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Abonanee, limm re me n nyon tv-n bade afung, a ngare nyi nsol nyio bahke limi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 24:36; 16:3</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Tibre wahnfono antahng kpꞌkahne re, efung bi Ntul a Jisos bahke bake, á bahke gbede na ana nwajv atv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 24:42-44; Ell 3:3</char></note><verse eid="1TH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Ane lꞌkehm tongo re, “Anv, wahr ebbel elkoono, ntong anyehng anyehng nehm kpe jol, wahr ebfor,” owo Esowo bahke soro ba rannge bo tvtv.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 24:39</char></note> Á bahke gbede ana ejel gbede nnenkal no ma sa ela. Nne awohng awohng nehm jol, no bahke foro.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Abonanee, ń jehkem go ejannge, efung bio wahn nehm gbede ana nwajv. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Tibre wahn ane kpee, ń li abon ba ellennge, ń tob li abon ba efung fvfo. E limm ka atv, jol e tobem li ka ejannge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 13:12</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Nong, wahr kꞌjo lal ana egom ane bako kpꞌlale. Nong, wahr jo ji, fere jo baabe. Amahr enyahre jol sange sange.<verse eid="1TH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Tibre ane ba kpo lal, bo kpo lal atv. Ane bao ba kpo wo bꞌbuumu, bo kpo buumu atv. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Eji e li ka efung, nong, amahr enyahre jol sange sange, wahr jo rod eltaame, a elkoro, kak ana ngbanggbang nyi nsoja kpo kak, jo bulu ngang. Wahr tob konngo ekpasi nsoja ji li ekunukpu re Esowo bahk-r tahre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 6:14-17</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Esowo wahr yehkem re wahr nyehn erem bi erakatahng eje. Á yehk-r re wahr bel eltahre ni kpo sehng go abo nya Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />no kpoo, tib go egahre esi, eji e lꞌjol a ne go elkpin ngare nyi á lꞌba, afi e kpo na, afi e li go elkpin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 14:7-9</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Ano wo fvfo nobo re, wahn jo kak atemtem eltim, fere jo kak atemtem ebo, jang jang ana ń kpꞌlimi anv.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esꞌkohro erehke ji Pol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Abonanee, n kp-n gboongo re wahn jo kak ane ba kpo lim eltum go egahne ellong, bo jio ji kp-n fili, fere jo rehk-n go mbang nyi Jehova. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Nong, bo jo sahb lub-n lub, fere jo kor-n, tib go eltum ni bo kpꞌlimi. Jolen go elkoono atemtem!<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Abonanee, e kp-n tongo re, wahn jo rehke ane ba kil eljene go nseenge. Jo kaken ane ba kil jo sahb erem eltim. Jo kaken ane ba kil tahne ebo. Jo kpuumen ka nne awohng awohng. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Jo kunen ekpu, eji nne awohng awohng lꞌkꞌjo ko ebi, feere ebi. Jo kaken esi go nnoobo alimi ka atemtem ngare anyehng anyehng, wahn fere jo lim ka ane kpee.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom 12:17-21; 1 Pit 3:9</char></note><verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Jo belen eyebatahng ngare anyehng anyehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fil 4:4</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Jo kaken ero, kꞌkim ekidi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 18:1; Kol 4:2</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Jo kaken saam go ejum ajehng ajehng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ef 5:20</char></note> Tibre mbang nyia nyi Esowo kpꞌsebe re wahn toono, eji ń kpꞌtoono Jisos Kraist.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Kana jo tele Etingi Etohko gono. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Kana jo daange enyehnamahr ji Esowo. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Jo wuungen ejum ajehng ajehng, wahn jo kuuru ji kpꞌnobo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor 14:29; 1 Jon 4:1</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Jahngen elkohn ebꞌbi anehng anehng.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Nong, Esowo bio bi elkoono lim-n, wahn sahb jꞌjol ejahne ejahne, fere lim atohko enyahne, a ntim enyahne, a agubjing enyahne fere jol saang, wahn kꞌbel egahme ajehng ajehng efung bi Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre bahke bake.<verse eid="1TH 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Nne no kp-n lungu, á kpi ekakesehk ji á bahke limi ano.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Abonanee, jo kaken ero ka-r.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Kaken abonane ejahne kpee nnyo go mbarebara nnyo asodo mio mi elkoro.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />N kp-n tongo, fere rehk-n go mbing nyi Ntul a Jisos re, wahn lung nwer nyia a, tong abonane ejahne kpee.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Nong, nnoobo nyi Jisos Kraist Ntul ewahre jol a nahne.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>